"{\n \"url\": \"https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/Pray-For-Plagues-Souls-borne-Prototype-ff37216d8bc582719a9981258a2d28c6\",\n \"text\": \"Skip to content\\nPray For Plagues, Souls-borne Prototype\\nGet Notion free\\nPray For Plagues, Souls-borne Prototype\\nMy LinkedIn\\nMy GitHub\\nMax — Gameplay Programmer (Unreal Engine 5)\\nFeatured Project:\\nPray For Plagues— Action RPG Combat Prototype (UE5)\\nA Souls-borne inspired dungeon exploration prototype featuring animation‑driven melee combat, reactive AI, and a modular ability system built in C++.\\nAbout Me:\\nHello there! I’m Max, and I’m a gameplay programmer focused on building expressive, systemic action gameplay in Unreal Engine 5. I specialize in melee combat, AI behavior, animation‑driven mechanics, and modular ability systems — the kind of gameplay where every frame, hit, and reaction matters.\\nThis project was made entirely by myself. Ive started learning UE back in 2019 and in 2024 I’ve began developing this project. Ive always been passionate about gaming in general and my dream is to release my own title someday. I’m also very eager to join into a team that would support me and help me grow, learn and improve while giving my best to create something great together.\\nIf you’re building ambitious action gameplay and want someone who can take a mechanic from concept to polished implementation, count me in!\\nProject Details\\nSystems Documentation\\nProject Overview\\nA project overview explaining the project and my contributions\\nCombat System Breakdown\\nAn in depth breakdown of players combat system \\nInteraction System Breakdown\\nA breakdown of the interaction system of the player with the world\\nAudio & Feedback System Breakdown\\nBreakdown of the audio and visual feedback system integrated within combat and exploration\\nInventory System Breakdown\\nBreakdown on item management within the inventory\\nAI System Breakdown\\nBreakdown on AI behavior and management within the world\\nLevel Design Breakdown\\nShowcase of the level design for the level that I have made and the reasoning behind it\\nSkills\\nSkills\\nSoftware\\nExpertise\\nLanguage\\nEnglish\\nRussian\\nHebrew\\nUkrainian\\n2026 DuckTemplates\\nCopy link to view\\nOpen as full page\\nCopy link to view\\nOpen as full page\\nShare site\\nPray For Plagues, Souls-…\\nGet Notion free\\nPray For Plagues, Souls-…\\nMy LinkedIn\\nMy GitHub\\nMax — Gameplay Programmer (Unreal Engine 5)\\nCopy URL\\nSign up or log in\\nReport page\\nCookie settings\\nStrictly necessary\\nEssential for the site to function. Always On.\\nFunctional\\nUsed to remember preference selections and provide enhanced features.\\nAnalytics\\nUsed to measure usage and improve your experience.\\nMarketing\\nUsed for targeted advertising.\\nProject\\nGitHub\\nShort Description\\nSkills\\nTableau\\nProject\\nGitHub\\nShort Description\\nSkills\\nTableau\\nName\\nType\\nLanguage\",\n \"media\": [\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3A3bfcd7c6-baf2-4ae1-bb91-60eb6b85fa0f%3AScreenShot00001.png?table=block&id=ff37216d-8bc5-8271-9a99-81258a2d28c6&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=1860&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/https%3A%2F%2Fprod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com%2F9ee57450-8969-49b7-8fc4-869a4c63073a%2F05a22a3b-a207-43fe-95f9-5a8554b446eb%2Flinkedin-icon-1024x1024-net2o24e.png?table=block&id=8e67216d-8bc5-8304-8930-01b3ec450d9d&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=40&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/https%3A%2F%2Fprod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com%2F9ee57450-8969-49b7-8fc4-869a4c63073a%2Fd560817c-b8a4-4c76-bac8-80d9755a896f%2F25231.png?table=block&id=3847216d-8bc5-8240-8f9b-0194a155ee41&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=40&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \